    "The podcasts you purchase in Apple Podcasts Subscriptions are associated with your Apple ID. Your device trust score is used to prevent fraud. Data on your podcast listening and interactions is also used to improve and personalize the service and is not associated with your Apple ID. See how your data is managed..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The podcasts you purchase in Apple Podcasts Subscriptions are associated with your Apple ID. Your device trust score is used to prevent fraud. Data on your podcast listening and interactions is also used to improve and personalize the service and is not associated with your Apple ID. See how your data is managed..."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los pódcast que compras en las Suscripciones de Apple Podcasts están asociados con tu Apple ID. Tu puntuación de confianza del dispositivo se utiliza para prevenir fraudes. Los datos sobre tu escucha de pódcast e interacciones también se utilizan para mejorar y personalizar el servicio y no están asociados con tu Apple ID. Consulta cómo se gestionan tus datos..."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您在 Apple Podcasts 订阅中购买的播客与您的 Apple ID 相关联。您的设备信任评分用于防止欺诈。您的播客收听和互动数据也用于改进和个性化服务，并且不会与您的 Apple ID 关联。查看您的数据是如何管理的..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
